            </div>

            <div>
                <h4>Contemporary Musical Art and Computer Technologies</h4>
                <em>Textbook</em>
                <b>2022</b>
            </div>

            <div>
                <h4>Artificial Intelligence Systems in Music Education: Experience of Use</h4>
